--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2b464e9a084143d0b286b1a9c537bec9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Window Dashboard Drawer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: window
  order: 0
  title: Window
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 299c416718aca461bba0329314c66746, type: 3}
  shortDescription: "H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 l\xE0m
    UI trong game"
  fullDescription: "<b><size=15>\u0110\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o nhanh m\u1ED9t window:</size></b>\nChu\u1ED9t
    ph\u1EA3i trong scene/ZeroX/Window Template/Ch\u1ECDn lo\u1EA1i ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p
    vs nhu c\u1EA7u.\n\n\nM\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 setting c\u1EE7a Window\n\n<b><size=15>1,
    Use GUICamera</size></b>\nKhi s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng Canvas d\u1EA1ng ScreenSpace
    - Camera, khi window \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c sinh ra s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng
    l\u1EA5y GUICamera \u0111\u1EC3 set cho Canvas\n\n\n<b><size=15>2, Sorting Config</size></b>\nKhi
    m\u1ED9t window \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c Open, n\xF3 s\u1EBD lu\xF4n hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB
    ph\xEDa tr\xEAn c\xE1c window kh\xE1c trong c\xF9ng layer (layer c\u1EE7a h\u1EC7
    th\u1ED1ng window ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i layer c\u1EE7a Unity)\n\nVisible
    When Behind: N\u1EBFu t\u1EAFt th\xEC khi m\u1ED9t window kh\xE1c hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB
    ph\xEDa tr\xEAn th\xEC window n\xE0y s\u1EBD b\u1ECB v\xF4 h\xECnh. N\u1EBFu
    b\u1EADt th\xEC s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB v\xF4 h\xECnh \n\n\n<b><size=15>3, Transition</size></b>\nKi\u1EC3m
    so\xE1t th\u1EDDi gian v\xE0 ho\u1EA1t \u1EA3nh \u0111\xF3ng m\u1EDF window.\n\nMode
    - Global: s\u1EBD s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng setting t\u1EEB Global Window Transition,
    h\u1EEFu \xEDch khi mu\u1ED1n t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 window chung m\u1ED9t ho\u1EA1t
    \u1EA3nh v\xE0 khi c\u1EA7n thay \u0111\u1ED5i ho\u1EA1t \u1EA3nh c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    thay \u0111\u1ED5i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3.\n\nMode - Custom: c\u1EA5u
    h\xECnh ho\u1EA1t \u1EA3nh ri\xEAng cho window \u0111\xF3\n\n\nAnimType - None:
    kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ho\u1EA1t \u1EA3nh, khi g\u1ECDi Open ho\u1EB7c Close s\u1EBD
    m\u1EDF v\xE0 \u0111\xF3ng ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c.\n\nAnimType - Pure: L\xE0
    anim d\u1EA1ng script \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n, ho\xE0n to\xE0n l\xE0 code, truy
    v\u1EA5n qua id.\n\nAnimType - MonoBehaviour: L\xE0 anim s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u1ED9t
    script MonoBehaviour \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m ho\u1EA1t \u1EA3nh, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1EAFn
    ngay v\xE0o Window. Ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho c\xE1c anim ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p c\u1EA7n
    ref nhi\u1EC1u th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n trong Window\n\nAnimType - ScriptableObject:
    L\xE0 anim s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u1ED9t ScriptableObject \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m ho\u1EA1t
    \u1EA3nh, v\u1EC1 c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n kh\xE1 gi\u1ED1ng Pure, ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 kh\xF4ng
    c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i id v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t trong Window nh\u01B0
    MonoBehaviour.\n\n\n<b><size=15>4, Advanced</size></b>\nAction Type When Closed:
    Khi Window \u0111\xF3ng th\xEC s\u1EBD l\xE0m g\xEC, Deactive Window hay ch\u1EC9
    v\xF4 h\xECnh (T\u1EAFt canvas v\xE0 raycast target)"
  listRequiredSdkDefine: []
  listOptionalSdkDefine: []
